        st:reason "Footnote l on this row ('Refer to Table 1–1 PK, PD and Biomarker sampling.') points to Table 1–1, which gives the within-visit sampling timepoints for the row; the table details the row, nothing is merged. Not recorded for 'Study drug intake at the site' (also marked l): Table 1–1 gives sampling timepoints, not an intake schedule." .

